  "query": "What is the area of Germany in square kilometres?",
  "answer": "Germany covers about **357,600 km²**. The official figure from Germany's Federal Statistical Office (Destatis) is **357,683 km²** as of 31 December 2024 [1]. You may see slightly different numbers elsewhere. Older references often give about 357,021–357,022 km², with roughly 8,350 km² of that being water [2][3]. The differences come from changes in survey methods and reference dates, not from any real change in the border.",
